{"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swami"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"code":".origami","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"metadata":{"externalID":"Swami","title":"Swami","modules":[{"name":"Swami"}],"symbolKind":"module","roleHeading":"Framework","role":"collection"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/OrigamiMappings","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Beats"],"title":"Reference","anchor":"Reference"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Drag"],"title":"Helpers","anchor":"Helpers"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/TouchOrigamiExampleView","doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView"],"title":"Examples","anchor":"Examples"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_Drag"],"generated":true,"title":"Articles","anchor":"Articles"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/docume